  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water, Sanitation and Hygiene results programme to support scale-up efforts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support poor people to access improved water and sanitation, and to introduce improved hygiene practices, to support the UK Government&apos;s targets of reaching 60 million people with improved water, sanitation and hygiene initiatives, in line with millennium development goal 7c by 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
